# Rechnung (M7, D-106): the Oberkellner's bill ("Zahlen, bitte!").
# A white w slip with m item lines, a short r total and a torn zigzag
# bottom, i shade on the right; k outline. flutter: tilting left/right while
# it falls. hang: the 30-frame hang at the ceiling (the volley's telegraph),
# a slow wobble. Built with a scratch script (1 px shear tilts +
# automatic k outline), frozen to text here.
sprite = rechnung
size   = 12x12
origin = 6,12
hitbox = 2,2,8,8
mirror = none
anim   = flutter frames=2 ticks=8 loop
anim   = hang    frames=2 ticks=12 loop
---
frame flutter 0
............
